# The Vercel CLI reads the .vercelignore of the directory it is run from. The
# deploy is run from the repository root, where the same two rules live. This
# copy covers a `vercel deploy` typed from inside apps/web: without it, that
# upload would carry apps/web/.env (see the root .vercelignore for why that
# file must never leave this machine).
# scripts/preflight-env.test.mjs fails if these two lines go.
.env
.env.*
